\n\n\n# Coefficient Plots\n\n## {.smaller}\n\n<br> \n\nThis doesn't look that great...\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code  code-fold=\"true\" code-summary=\"Show the code\"}\nmodelsummary(conflict_model, \n             stars = TRUE,  \n             gof_map = c(\"nobs\"),\n             coef_map = coef_map,\n             title = caption, \n             notes = reference)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vincentarelbundock/tinytable@main/inst/tinytable.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n      // Create table-specific functions using external factory\n      const tableFns_c73mx8rir85kuzyhq7um = TinyTable.createTableFunctions(\"tinytable_c73mx8rir85kuzyhq7um\");\n      // tinytable span after\n      window.addEventListener('load', function () {\n          var cellsToStyle = [\n            // tinytable style arrays after\n          { positions: [ { i: '15', j: 2 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_dr9wjd8wrgg0om0q2zbl',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '14', j: 2 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_unifv4x47vg5cc699xlx',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '1', j: 2 }, { i: '2', j: 2 }, { i: '3', j: 2 }, { i: '4', j: 2 }, { i: '5', j: 2 }, { i: '6', j: 2 }, { i: '7', j: 2 }, { i: '8', j: 2 }, { i: '9', j: 2 }, { i: '10', j: 2 }, { i: '11', j: 2 }, { i: '12', j: 2 }, { i: '13', j: 2 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_2sfqlmv09qwlhbgls95d',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '0', j: 2 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_57o48g90tier3wn6j93x',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '15', j: 1 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_sb1toykhalbtxwusfgmu',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '14', j: 1 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_y2wiz3mds1rl56u7alt6',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '1', j: 1 }, { i: '2', j: 1 }, { i: '3', j: 1 }, { i: '4', j: 1 }, { i: '5', j: 1 }, { i: '6', j: 1 }, { i: '7', j: 1 }, { i: '8', j: 1 }, { i: '9', j: 1 }, { i: '10', j: 1 }, { i: '11', j: 1 }, { i: '12', j: 1 }, { i: '13', j: 1 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_8dfv6ugg04wxxidfejfw',}, 