10.1_files/figure-revealjs/coef_plot-1.png){width=960}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Your Turn!\n\n- Take one of your models\n- Use `modelplot` to create a coefficient plot of it\n- Customize the plot to your liking\n- Interpret the results\n- Discuss advantages of coefficient plots with a neighbor\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<countdown-timer class=\"countdown\" id=\"timer_09d74ecb\" minutes=\"10\" seconds=\"0\" update-every=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"right:10%;bottom:5%;\"></countdown-timer>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n",
